[00:00.00]Open up!|打开吧！
[00:03.00]Wow! So much money here!|哇！这里有好多钱！
[00:08.00]Grandma, let's go shopping!|奶奶，我们去买东西吧！
[00:16.00]Cover your ears!|捂住耳朵！
[00:21.00]Wow! It's raining popcorn!|哇！下爆米花雨啦！
[00:25.00]Let's buy some.|我们买一些吧。
[00:27.00]Spin the wheel.|转一下转盘。
[00:28.00]Round and round.|转呀转，转呀转。
[00:31.16]I want a dragon!|我想要一条龙！
[00:34.46]Wow, I'm so lucky!|哇，我运气真好！
[00:37.36]Here is your dragon.|你的龙给你。
[00:41.38]Thank you.|谢谢。
[00:43.72]Excuse me, how much is this frog?|打扰一下，这只青蛙多少钱？
[00:47.76]Ten yuan.|十块钱。
[00:49.20]Too expensive.|太贵了。
[00:50.76]How about eight yuan?|八块钱行吗？
[00:53.52]Okay, deal.|好，成交。
[00:55.06]Here you go.|给你。
[00:58.00]Hop, hop, little frog.|跳呀跳，小青蛙。
[01:03.06]Be careful, my little frog.|小心点，我的小青蛙。
[01:06.24]Try some, Grandma.|尝一尝，奶奶。
[01:09.08]Mmm, so sweet.|嗯，真甜。
[01:11.68]Thank you.|谢谢。
[01:12.94]I want to share it with you.|我想跟你一起分享。
